          },
          "body": "Odi,\nI do not mind it being called differently. I did try to concentrate primarily on\nthe performance optimization, though. And I would not call disabling cookie\nprocessing and stale connection check best practices but I really do not mind\nexpanding the scope of the document\n\nOleg",
