            "displayName": "Michael Becke",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "Hi Oleg,\n\nThis looks like an excellent start.  Though this document does appear to be a combination of best \npractices and optimization techniques.  Perhaps we should try to separate these two things and have \ndocs for both?\n\nI also agree that HttpClient is long overdue for a Wiki.  It would be particularly useful for adding \nresponses to the many questions we see over and over again, something like a combination FAQ/\ntroubleshooting guide.\n\nMike",
