          "body": "Created an attachment (id=13986)\nDoc patch\n\nThis patch cleans up some of the text, and adds a little here and there. It\nalso includes the changes Odi made.  I think this document looks pretty good\nnow, though I agree with Odi that the \"Reuse the HttpClient instance\" seems a\nlittle unnecessary.  The only real thing I think we need to encourage reuse of\nis the connection managers.  This is covered some for the MTCM but we could\nstill use a little something in regard to the simple connection manager.\n\nMike",
